  "notes": "{失|うしな}う is a godan verb meaning to lose, typically used for abstract or significant things rather than everyday objects.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pattern: 〜⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{失|うしな}う\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{自信|じしん}→自信：10143_jishin⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{失|うしな}う: to lose confidence\n- ⟦{意識|いしき}→意識：01714_ishiki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{失|うしな}う: to lose consciousness\n- ⟦{命|いのち}→命：02371_inochi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{失|うしな}う: to lose one's life\n- ⟦{信頼|しんらい}→信頼：03268_shinrai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{失|うしな}う: to lose trust\n- ⟦{記憶|きおく}→記憶：00234_kioku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{失|うしな}う: to lose one's memory\n- ⟦{財産|ざいさん}→財産：01635_zaisan⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{失|うしな}う: to lose one's fortune\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦なくす→無くす：01110_nakusu⟧: to lose (concrete objects like keys, wallet — more casual)\n- {失|うしな}う: to lose (abstract things, significant losses — more formal/literary)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{失|うしな}っている indicates a resulting state: \"has lost\" / \"is without.\"",
